{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52255","headline":"诗（幷序） 十六 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"善劝诸贵等，□□□□□。\n火急造桥梁，运度身得过。\n福至生西方，各难知厌足。\n身是有限身，程期太剧促。\n纵有百年活，徘徊如转烛。\n憨人连脑痴，买锦妻装束。\n无心造福田，有意事奴仆。\n只得蹔时劳（项校「牢」），旷身入苦毒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}